{c: Chorus}

[C]Bimbo, Bimbo, where ya gonna go-e-o

[G]Bimbo, Bimbo, whatcha gonna [C]do-e-o

[C]Bimbo, Bimbo, [F]does your mommy know

That you're [G]goin' down the road to see a [C]little girleo.

{c: Verse 1}

[C]Bimbo is a [F]little [D7]boy who's [G]got a million [C]friends,

[C]And every time he [F]passes [D7]by, they [G]all invite him [C]in.

[C]He'll [G]clap his hands and sing and dance, and talk his baby talk,

[G]With a hole in his pants and his knees a-stickin' out,

he's just big enough to walk.

Repeat Chorus

{c: Verse 2}

[C]Bimbo's got two [F] big blue [D7]eyes that [G]light up like a [C]star,

[C]And the way to [F]light them [D7]up is to [G]buy him candy [C]bars.

[G]Crackerjacks and bubblegum will start his day off right,

[G]All the girlies follow him just a-beggin' him for a bite.

Repeat Chorus

